no! Example 8: a five-parameter function summing its arguments, called
with NOOOOOO UUUUUUUU. The sixth argument is popped and discarded;
parameters arrive in the one- to five-space slots. !no
nooooo uuuuuu
	no u, no  u, nooo u, no   u, nooo u, no    u, nooo u, no     u, nooo u, NO      u
	no	u, no      u, No, No, No, No, No, NOOOOOO UUUUUUUU
NO U
no u, !1!, !2!, !3!, !4!, !5!, !0!, NOOOOOO UUUUUUUU
